dev/plans/runs/0.8.20-slice-23-output.json:28:    "LEG 2 / TC-91 (a) — THE MEASUREMENT TRAP, DISARMED FIRST AND VERIFIED RATHER THAN ASSUMED. Two defences, both mechanical: (i) every duplicate arm runs inside a SINGLE open of a fresh workspace whose embed log starts empty — `_fathomdb_vector_kinds` is empty at open so `run_vector_equivalence_probe` returns early (lib.rs:15348-15353) having embedded nothing, and the kind is enrolled AFTER open; (ii) every body carries the marker `tc91marker` which no probe text contains, ingest and probe embeds are counted separately and NEVER summed, and EVERY duplicate arm asserts `probe_calls == 0` so a broken separation fails the arm instead of silently contaminating the number. Measured probe contribution: 0 in all 20 duplicate runs.",
