   366	This slice adds **13 test functions across two targets. 9 are `#[ignore]`d; 4 run in the default
   367	`cargo test` profile.** The decision was taken per target, not by reflex, and the gating question
   368	is ledger **TC-72**: roughly 1 workspace run in 3 already fails on plain `main`, so anything
   369	timing-sensitive added to the default profile makes that worse and has to earn its place.
   370	
