   344	| pin | engine call | transaction behaviour | result | wall time |
   345	|---|---|---|---|---|
   346	| 2 | `Engine::transition` | `BEGIN DEFERRED`, read-then-upgrade (`lib.rs:8221`) | **`Err(Storage)`** | **0 ms** |
   347	| 3 | `Engine::write` | `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` (`lib.rs:18637`, the TC-57 fix) | **`Ok`** | **834 ms** |
