   350	then succeeded — which is the positive proof that the busy handler *was* consulted on that path,
   351	in direct contrast to pin 1's zero invocations on the promoting path.
   352	
   353	**So the answer is: yes, empirically, on this engine, at this baseline.** The remedy is not
   354	being transferred by analogy — the very same database, the very same contention, and the very
